{"availability":"available","full":"dipak-nehe/stock-trend-analyzer","name":"stock-trend-analyzer","description":"10 years of SEC filings for any US-listed company: trends, 20+ red flags, SEC filing history, insider trades, Graham & Buffett checklists, stock comparison. EN/ES. Python on Vercel, modular JS, 384 automated tests (Playwright, axe-core), public Allure report.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T03:08:11Z","updated":"2026-10-06T01:53:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stock-value-analysis.vercel.app","topics":["accessibility","allure","insider-trading","javascript","mypy","playwright","python","sec-edgar","stock-analysis","value-investing","vercel","xbrl"],"demo":"https://stock-value-analysis.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:03.024Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:03.024Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:03.024Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:03.024Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live site: stock-value-analysis.vercel.app · try AAPL, KO, SMCI","Web app that analyses 10 years of SEC filings for any US-listed company: an at-a-glance summary and 10-year trends, 20+ red-flag checks with plain-English explanations, SEC filing history (restatements, auditor changes, late filings, exchange notices and other serious 8-K events), insider trades from Form 4 filings, Graham & Buffett value checklists with price-based valuation, and a side-by-side comparison of two stocks. In English and Spanish, accessible (WCAG 2.2 AA) and phone-friendly. Python serverless backend on Vercel with stored results in Upstash Redis, and a modular JavaScript front…","All data comes from the companies' own filings through the free SEC EDGAR API."],"features":["At a glance, then tabs. Results open with six one-line verdicts (revenue, earnings, dividend, red flags, SEC record, value check